// CompilerDB-Backed Semantic LSP Query Handlers (`publishDiagnostics`, `hover`, `definition`,
// `typeDefinition`, `implementation`, `references`, `documentSymbol`, `workspace/symbol`,
// constraint-filtered `completion`, conflict-checked `prepareRename` & `rename`) and
// `AXCODEEDITOR` Semantic Presentation Layer (`semanticTokens/full`, `semanticTokens/full/delta`,
// ownership/capability/move/drop/async-suspension `inlayHint`, and highlight layer precedence) (T802 / E19.1).
// Implements SPEC-100 §§4..7 (AXS-LSP-001..004, AXS-LSP-030..032, AXS-LSP-040..043,
// AXS-LSP-050..051, AXS-LSP-060..063; REQ-TOOL-183, REQ-TOOL-185, REQ-TOOL-188,
// REQ-TOOL-189, REQ-TOOL-297, REQ-TOOL-298, REQ-TOOL-300, INV-LSP-002).
module compiler.lsp.handlers

